  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat the oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Halve snacking tomatoes. Thinly slice carrot into half-moons. Thickly slice brown onion into wedges.\n• Trim baby broccoli and slice in half lengthways.\n• Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices. In a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63a2c85559b15f456907ab52/step-9cb55dcb.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place snacking tomatoes, carrot and brown onion on a lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle garlic & herb seasoning and season with salt. Toss to coat.\n• Roast until slightly tender, 10-15 minutes.\n• Remove the tray from the oven and add baby broccoli. Return tray to the oven and roast for a further 10-15 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63a2c85559b15f456907ab52/step-4b7d90bc.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the veggies are roasting, cut or tear the bake-at-home ciabatta into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place on a second lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with shaved Parmesan cheese. Toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63a2c85559b15f456907ab52/step-54f2eeec.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Bake the croutons until golden, 5-7 minutes.\n• Meanwhile, drain haloumi and pat dry.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63a2c85559b15f456907ab52/step-5dc8c19c.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the roasted veggies have cooled slightly, add salad leaves, croutons and a drizzle of balsamic vinegar to the oven tray and gently toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63a2c85559b15f456907ab52/step-4b5ad388.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide the haloumi, veggie and garlic crouton salad between bowls.\n• Sprinkle with slivered almonds. Dollop creamy pesto dressing over the salad. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63a2c85559b15f456907ab52/step-589a47c0.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
